## 7. API Design

### 7.1 REST Endpoints

**Voice Profile Management**
```
POST   /api/v1/voice-profiles              # Upload sample, buat profile baru
GET    /api/v1/voice-profiles              # List profile milik user
GET    /api/v1/voice-profiles/{id}         # Detail satu profile
DELETE /api/v1/voice-profiles/{id}         # Hapus profile
PATCH  /api/v1/voice-profiles/{id}         # Update metadata
POST   /api/v1/voice-profiles/{id}/train   # Trigger training (async job)
GET    /api/v1/voice-profiles/{id}/status  # Cek status training
```

**TTS / Offline Cloning**
```
POST   /api/v1/tts/generate                # Body: {text, voice_profile_id, settings}
GET    /api/v1/tts/jobs/{job_id}           # Cek status + hasil job
```

**Auth & User**
```
POST   /api/v1/auth/register
POST   /api/v1/auth/login
GET    /api/v1/auth/me
```

**System**
```
GET    /api/v1/gpu-status                  # Cek availability GPU
```

### 7.2 WebSocket Schema (Real-time Voice Changer)

Endpoint: `wss://.../ws/voice-changer`

**Connection flow:**
```
Client                          Server
  │──── connect + auth token ────▶│
  │◀─── {"type": "ready"} ────────│
  │──── init_session ─────────────▶│
  │◀─── {"type": "session_ready"} ─│
  │──── audio_chunk (loop) ───────▶│
  │◀─── audio_chunk (loop) ────────│
  │──── close_session ────────────▶│
```

**Client → Server:**
```json
{
  "type": "init_session",
  "voice_profile_id": "uuid",
  "settings": {
    "pitch_shift": 0,
    "sample_rate": 16000,
    "chunk_duration_ms": 30
  }
}
```
```
<binary PCM audio data>
```
```json
{ "type": "update_settings", "settings": { "pitch_shift": 2 } }
{ "type": "close_session" }
```

**Server → Client:**
```json
{ "type": "session_ready", "session_id": "uuid" }
{ "type": "error", "message": "...", "code": "MODEL_LOAD_FAILED" }
```
```
<binary PCM audio data>
```
```json
{ "type": "metrics", "latency_ms": 87, "processing_ms": 45 }
```

