## 8. Database Schema

**users**
```sql
id              UUID PK
email           VARCHAR UNIQUE
password_hash   VARCHAR
created_at      TIMESTAMP
```

**voice_profiles**
```sql
id                    UUID PK
user_id               UUID FK -> users.id
name                  VARCHAR
source_type           ENUM('own_voice', 'other_person', 'character')
status                ENUM('pending', 'processing', 'ready', 'failed')
sample_audio_path     VARCHAR   -- Opus
model_checkpoint_path VARCHAR
duration_seconds      FLOAT
error_message         TEXT NULL
created_at            TIMESTAMP
updated_at            TIMESTAMP
```

**training_jobs**
```sql
id                UUID PK
voice_profile_id  UUID FK -> voice_profiles.id
status            ENUM('queued', 'processing', 'completed', 'failed')
progress_pct      INT DEFAULT 0
started_at        TIMESTAMP NULL
completed_at      TIMESTAMP NULL
error_log         TEXT NULL
```

**tts_jobs**
```sql
id                  UUID PK
user_id             UUID FK -> users.id
voice_profile_id    UUID FK -> voice_profiles.id
input_text          TEXT
status              ENUM('queued', 'processing', 'completed', 'failed')
output_audio_path   VARCHAR NULL   -- Opus
settings            JSONB
created_at          TIMESTAMP
completed_at        TIMESTAMP NULL
```

**vc_sessions**
```sql
id                UUID PK
user_id           UUID FK -> users.id
voice_profile_id  UUID FK -> voice_profiles.id
started_at        TIMESTAMP
ended_at          TIMESTAMP NULL
avg_latency_ms    FLOAT NULL
settings          JSONB
```

**Relasi:**
```
users (1) ──< (N) voice_profiles
voice_profiles (1) ──< (N) training_jobs
voice_profiles (1) ──< (N) tts_jobs
voice_profiles (1) ──< (N) vc_sessions
users (1) ──< (N) tts_jobs / vc_sessions
```

**Voice Profile Lifecycle:**
```
[Upload sample] → status: pending → (queue) → status: processing
                                          │
                              ┌───────────┴───────────┐
                              ▼                       ▼
                       status: ready           status: failed
```

Catatan desain: `sample_audio_path` dan `model_checkpoint_path` dipisah karena siklus hidupnya berbeda — sample bisa dihapus setelah training selesai, checkpoint tetap disimpan untuk inference.

